    "enUS": {
      "description": "Amongst the shattered fishing lures and tackle is a rolled, silken measuring tape.  Attached to the tape is a label that reads:\n\n\"Nat Pagle, Dustwallow Marsh.\"",
      "dialogue": {
        "6deccbe164f693da6bfc": "Hello there, $gladdie:lassy;. You here to do some fishing?",
        "95b20eb2078923fe9c63": "Why, you found my favorite measuring tape! I love this tape! I measured some of the biggest fish I ever caught with it...$B$BBut, I lost this tape in Zul'Gurub... you've been to Zul'Gurub? Did you see the fabled Gahz'ranka?$B$BWell... do you want to catch him?",
        "a7d1a63ec65bcf9ef585": "Hello there, $gladdie:lassy;. You here to do some fishing?"
      },
      "summary": "Return Nat's Measuring Tape to Nat Pagle in Dustwallow Marsh.",
      "title": "Nat's Measuring Tape",
